(2, 'Wooden Chess Set', 'A handcrafted wooden chess set with a foldable board and weighted pieces, ideal for family game nights, gifting, or building strategic thinking skills.', 899.00, 180, 'Toys', 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/10626005/pexels-photo-10626005.jpeg'),
(3, 'Terracotta Serving Bowl', 'A hand-shaped terracotta serving bowl with a warm, earthy matte finish, ideal for serving salads, snacks, or fruits while adding a rustic touch to your table.', 699.00, 100, 'Home', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610701596007-11502861dcfa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80'),
(3, 'Linen Kitchen Towels', 'A set of two soft, highly absorbent linen kitchen towels in natural tones, durable enough for everyday cooking, cleaning, and drying tasks.', 549.00, 160, 'Home', 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/4794899/pexels-photo-4794899.jpeg'),
(3, 'Neem Wood Comb', 'A smooth, hand-finished comb carved from natural neem wood, gentle on the scalp and known to reduce hair breakage as part of a simple daily hair-care ritual.', 199.00, 28, 'Wellness', 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/15694772/pexels-photo-15694772.jpeg'),
