(6, 'Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds', 'Compact true wireless in-ear earbuds offering clear sound, a secure fit, and up to 20 hours of combined battery life with the included charging case.', 1099.00, 400, 'Electronics', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590658268037-6bf12165a8df?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80'),
